  "question": {
    "text": "<p>How many moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions are formed when excess of iron react with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math>, under inert atmosphere?</p><p>(assume no change in volume)</p>",
